  "extract_html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"ib-wrap\" style=\"width:290px\">\n   \n<aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-orange pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"Box title\">Nuclear Capacitor</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/1/13/Pandor_Prypiatosian-B_%28Ben_10%29.png/revision/latest?cb=20200125013404\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Pandor Prypiatosian-B (Ben 10)\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/1/13/Pandor_Prypiatosian-B_%28Ben_10%29.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/515?cb=20200125013404\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/1/13/Pandor_Prypiatosian-B_%28Ben_10%29.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/515?cb=20200125013404 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/1/13/Pandor_Prypiatosian-B_%28Ben_10%29.png/revision/latest?cb=20200125013404 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Pandor Prypiatosian-B (Ben 10)\" width=\"270\" height=\"288\" data-image-key=\"Pandor_Prypiatosian-B_%28Ben_10%29.png\" data-image-name=\"Pandor Prypiatosian-B (Ben 10).png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Prypiatosian Bs (Ben 10) such as P’andor can absorb and store various forms of energy inside themselves, especially nuclear radiological energies.</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Row 1 info\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Power/Ability to:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Store nuclear energy/connected forces.</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<p>The power to <b>absorb and store nuclear energy/connected forces for later use</b>. Sub-power of <a href=\"/wiki/Nuclear_Absorption\" title=\"Nuclear Absorption\">Nuclear Absorption</a>. Variation of <a href=\"/wiki/Capacitor\" title=\"Capacitor\">Capacitor</a>\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Also_Called\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Also Called</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Capabilities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Capabilities</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Applications\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Applications</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Associations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Associations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Known_Users\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Users</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Videos\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Videos</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Also_Called\">Also Called</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FNuclear_Capacitor%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Living Nuclear Battery/Capacitance</li>\n<li>Nuclear Storage/Containment</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Capabilities\">Capabilities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FNuclear_Capacitor%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The user can absorb nuclear energy/connected forces, storing it for later use. They are able to use the stored energy for any purpose they see fit, channeling it however they please.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Applications\">Applications</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FNuclear_Capacitor%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Energetic_Sourcing\" title=\"Bio-Energetic Sourcing\">Bio-Energetic Sourcing</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Energetic_Transduction\" title=\"Bio-Energetic Transduction\">Bio-Energetic Transduction</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Energetic_Ionization\" title=\"Energetic Ionization\">Energetic Ionization</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Ionic_Capacitor\" title=\"Ionic Capacitor\">Ionic Capacitor</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Gamma_Capacitor\" title=\"Gamma Capacitor\">Gamma Capacitor</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Nuclear_Absorption\" title=\"Nuclear Absorption\">Nuclear Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Nuclear_Accumulation\" title=\"Nuclear Accumulation\">Nuclear Accumulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Nuclear_Attacks\" title=\"Nuclear Attacks\">Nuclear Attacks</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Nuclear_Infusion\" title=\"Nuclear Infusion\">Nuclear Infusion</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Nuclear_Empowerment\" title=\"Nuclear Empowerment\">Nuclear Empowerment</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Electromagnetism_Empowerment\" title=\"Electromagnetism Empowerment\">Electromagnetism Empowerment</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Electromagnetic_Vision\" title=\"Electromagnetic Vision\">Electromagnetic Vision</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Particle_Empowerment\" title=\"Particle Empowerment\">Particle Empowerment</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Ion_Empowerment\" title=\"Ion Empowerment\">Ion Empowerment</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Self-Sustenance\" title=\"Self-Sustenance\">Self-Sustenance</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Power_Augmentation\" title=\"Power Augmentation\">Power Augmentation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Self-Power_Augmentation\" title=\"Self-Power Augmentation\">Self-Power Augmentation</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Nuclear_Power\" title=\"Personal Nuclear Power\">Personal Nuclear Power</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Activation_Energy\" title=\"Personal Activation Energy\">Personal Activation Energy</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Nuclear_Fire\" title=\"Personal Nuclear Fire\">Personal Nuclear Fire</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Quantum_Energy\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Personal Quantum Energy\">Personal Quantum Energy</a></li></ul></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Quantum_Absorption\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Quantum Absorption\">Quantum Absorption</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Associations\">Associations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FNuclear_Capacitor%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Ambient_Energy_Manipulation\" title=\"Ambient Energy Manipulation\">Ambient Energy Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Capacitance_Manipulation\" title=\"Capacitance Manipulation\">Capacitance Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Elemental_Manipulation\" title=\"Elemental Manipulation\">Elemental Manipulation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Absorption\" title=\"Energy Absorption\">Energy Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Conversion\" title=\"Energy Conversion\">Energy Conversion</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Manipulation\" title=\"Energy Manipulation\">Energy Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><